  "description": "Bomin became a young shaman after receiving a divine calling at an early age. But his patron deity is oddly obsessed with him, constantly demanding unnecessary physical affection. Strangely enough, every time he gives in, Bomin’s fortune-telling accuracy shoots up to 100%!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/100percent), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3943381), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52662778)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/100percent)",
